      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Katong Laksa, a spicy coconut‑based noodle dish, originated in the 1950s and remains a culinary staple of the neighbourhood.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
