      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katong",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1993, Joo Chiat, the historic core of Katong, was declared a national heritage conservation area for its mixed Chinese, Peranakan and English colonial architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
