      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katong",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During Japanese occupation, shophouses between Wilkinson and Goodman Roads housed comfort women, a dark chapter still remembered today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
