      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katong",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Wealthy merchants built seaside villas along Katong’s beachfront from the late 19th century, turning the area into a resort for the elite.",
